OL,3,GNEWSAFox rescued from drain after
OL,4,Anine-hour ordeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers spent more than nine hours
OL,7,Ffreeing a fox trapped in a drain.
OL,9,FThe animal got stuck in the pipes
OL,10,Funderneath a housing estate in
OL,11,FHumberston, North East Lincolnshire on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FFirefighters, volunteers from
OL,15,FCleethorpes Wildlife Rescue (CWR) and
OL,16,Fengineers from Anglian Water eventually
OL,17,Frescued the animal which was wedged in
OL,18,Fa 4in (10cm) wide pipe before taking it
OL,19,Fto a vet for treatment to its injuries.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
